        "description": "Stylesheet providing responsive layout rules, design token variables, and user interface styling.",
        "content": "/* NeoMarket Public Styles - Modern E-commerce Look (Amazon/Digikala Inspired) */\n\n:root {\n    --neomarket-primary: #ef394e; /* Digikala Red */\n    --neomarket-text: #3f4064;\n    --neomarket-gray: #7a7a7a;\n    --neomarket-border: #e0e0e2;\n    --neomarket-bg: #f5f5f5;\n}\n\n.neomarket-container {\n    font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;\n    color: var(--neomarket-text);\n    position: relative;\n    min-height: 400px;\n}\n\n.neomarket-container.loading {\n    opacity: 0.6;\n    pointer-events: none;\n}\n\n/* Catalog Layout */\n.neomarket-store-layout {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 20px;\n}\n\n.neomarket-sidebar {\n    flex: 0 0 250px;\n    background: #fff;\n    padding: 20px;\n    border: 1px solid var(--neomarket-border);\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    height: fit-content;\n}\n\n.neomarket-main-content {\n    flex: 1;\n}\n\n.neomarket-filter-widget {\n    margin-bottom: 25px;\n}\n\n.neomarket-filter-widget h3 {\n    font-size: 16px;\n    margin-bottom: 15px;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--neomarket-border);\n    padding-bottom: 5px;\n}\n\n.neomarket-cat-list {\n    list-style: none;\n    padding: 0;\n}\n\n.neomarket-cat-list a {\n    text-decoration: none;\n    color: var(--neomarket-text);\n    display: block;\n    padding: 5px 0;\n    transition: color 0.2s;\n}\n\n.neomarket-cat-list a:hover, .neomarket-cat-list a.active {\n    color: var(--neomarket-primary);\n}\n\n/* Product Grid */\n.neomarket-product-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(220px, 1fr));\n    gap: 20px;\n}\n\n.neomarket-product-card {\n    background: #fff;\n    border: 1px solid var(--neomarket-border);\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;\n    cursor: pointer;\n}\n\n.neomarket-product-card:hover {\n    transform: translateY(-5px);\n    box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\n}\n\n.neomarket-product-card .product-thumbnail img {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 200px;\n    object-fit: cover;\n}\n\n.neomarket-product-card .product-info {\n    padding: 15px;\n}\n\n.neomarket-product-card .product-title {\n    font-size: 14px;\n    margin: 0 0 10px;\n    height: 40px;\n    overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n.neomarket-product-card .product-price {\n    margin-bottom: 15px;\n}\n\n.neomarket-product-card .sale-price {\n    color: var(--neomarket-primary);\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 18px;\n}\n\n.neomarket-product-card .regular-price-crossed {\n    text-decoration: line-through;\n    color: var(--neomarket-gray);\n    font-size: 14px;\n    margin-left: 10px;\n}\n\n/* Single Product */\n.neomarket-single-product {\n    background: #fff;\n    padding: 30px;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    border: 1px solid var(--neomarket-border);\n}\n\n.product-header {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 40px;\n    margin-bottom: 40px;\n}\n\n.product-gallery {\n    flex: 0 0 400px;\n}\n\n.product-main-info {\n    flex: 1;\n}\n\n.product-title {\n    font-size: 24px;\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n}\n\n.product-price-box {\n    margin: 20px 0;\n    padding: 20px;\n    background: #fdfdfd;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    border: 1px solid #eee;\n}\n\n.product-stock-status {\n    display: inline-block;\n    padding: 5px 15px;\n    border-radius: 20px;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    margin-bottom: 20px;\n}\n\n.product-stock-status.instock { background: #e8f5e9; color: #2e7d32; }\n.product-stock-status.outofstock { background: #ffebee; color: #c62828; }\n\n/* Tabs */\n.product-tabs {\n    margin-top: 40px;\n}\n\n.tab-nav {\n    display: flex;\n    list-style: none;\n    padding: 0;\n    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--neomarket-border);\n}\n\n.tab-nav li {\n    padding: 10px 30px;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    font-weight: bold;\n}\n\n.tab-nav li.active {\n    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--neomarket-primary);\n    color: var(--neomarket-primary);\n    margin-bottom: -2px;\n}\n\n.tab-content {\n    padding: 20px 0;\n}\n\n.tab-pane {\n    display: none;\n}\n\n.tab-pane.active {\n    display: block;\n}\n\n/* RTL Support */\nbody.rtl .neomarket-container {\n    direction: rtl;\n}\n\nbody.rtl .neomarket-product-card .regular-price-crossed {\n    margin-left: 0;\n    margin-right: 10px;\n}\n"
